  sha256 e97105553cd1987e7c9b4ed666998ea59dde67f0cd2078b2f2afa91315838419
  verbatim: "Covariate shift is when P(X) changes, but P(Y|X) remains the same."
  verbatim: "Concept drift is when P(Y|X) changes, but P(X) remains the same."
  verbatim: "A basic two-sample test is the Kolmogorov–Smirnov test, also known as K-S or KS test"
  -> B03 rows 1–3 and note ("after Huyen, 2022")
